  "index.md": "---\ndg-home: true\ndg-publish: true\nas: home\ntitle: György Gutai - Full Stack Web Developer\n\n---\n![[content/header]]\n## Full Stack Developer\n\n<hr class=\"header-separator\">\n\n### I do frontend\nReact, Next.js, TypeScript, Material UI, Tailwind, Storybook, micro-frontends, design systems\n\n### I do backend\nNode.js, NestJS, REST APIs, GraphQL, OpenAPI specs, SQL, Headless CMS, WordPress\n\n### I do AI\nAgent orchestration, context engineering, agent skill design, GPU cloud infra (RunPod, Vast.ai), serverless inference deployment (RunPod Flash), generative image & video\n\n### I do ops & tooling\nGitHub Actions, CI/CD pipelines, Docker, Cloudflare, webhooks & automation, VPS deployment\n\n---\n## Project History\n\n![[content/projects]]",
  "links.md": "---\ndg-publish: true\ndg-show-inline-title: true\ndg-permalink: links\nas: page\ntitle: 💪🏾 Notable Links\n---\n\n## [Face Value](https://face-value.gyorgygutai.dev) \n\nA minimal website that does fun things to your face. NextJS frontend, Flux.2 Klein 9B inference server on Runpod serverless.\n\n[Source on Github](https://github.com/gyorgygutai/face-value)\n\n---\n\n## [AI Image / Video Prompting](https://gen-ai-prompts.gyorgygutai.dev)\n\nAn Obsidian Digital Garden for generative AI art prompt engineering. Ready-to-use prompts, vocabulary, concepts and ideas.\n\n[Source on Github](https://github.com/gyorgygutai/generative-ai-prompts)\n\n---\n\n## [Draw Things GRPC Bridge](https://github.com/gyorgygutai/draw-things-grpc-bridge)\n\nAn Obsidian plugin that helps me co-locate my prompts with generated images. Sends prompts to Draw Things through the GRPC api.\n\n[Source on Github](https://github.com/gyorgygutai/draw-things-grpc-bridge)\n\n---\n\n## [gyorgygutai.dev](https://gyorgygutai.dev)\n\nThis very CV website is an Obsidian Digital Garden as well.\n\n[Source on Github](https://github.com/gyorgygutai/digitalgarden-cv)\n\n---",
